31:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary","children":"FAQs"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] lg:leading-tight","children":"LLP in Surat: common questions"}],null]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card","children":[["$","details","Is an LLP better than a company for a Surat textile firm?",{"className":"group","id":"surat-llp-registration-faq-1","name":"surat-llp-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is an LLP better than a company for a Surat textile firm?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"For most of them, yes, provided there is no plan to raise equity. An LLP caps personal liability, keeps the partner structure and profit shares intact, appears on the MCA register where banks and buyers can verify it, and avoids statutory audit from year one. A company only becomes the better answer when you need to issue shares or a specific counterparty insists on one."}]}]]}],["$","details","What happens to our existing partnership deed when we convert?",{"className":"group","id":"surat-llp-registration-faq-2","name":"surat-llp-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What happens to our existing partnership deed when we convert?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Its commercial substance moves into the LLP Agreement, which becomes the governing document and must be filed in Form 3 within thirty days of incorporation. This is a good opportunity to settle the things the old deed left vague, typically exit terms, what happens on a partner's death, and who may commit the business to credit."}]}]]}],["$","details","Will our bank accept an LLP for our working capital facility?",{"className":"group","id":"surat-llp-registration-faq-3","name":"surat-llp-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Will our bank accept an LLP for our working capital facility?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Banks lend to LLPs routinely, and the LLP's presence on the MCA register with filed annual accounts generally helps rather than hinders a credit assessment. What you should not assume is that an existing facility transfers automatically. The LLP is a new entity with a new PAN, so the facility has to be re-documented, and that is worth starting before the conversion rather than after."}]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
